        "MOSS SFT + community HQ Edit armV5, LoRA strength 1.0, native ai-toolkit format on BOTH conditionings, 50 Euler/simple steps, CFG 3, SLG layer 22. Not latent img2img. No prompt rewriting. Source is fitted to the selected working resolution (1 MP by default) and bottom/right padded to 16 pixels, not cropped. Padding is removed and the output returns to the exact original dimensions. Dimensions do not guarantee pixel-perfect generated content or restore missing source detail. Use Protected Mask Edit when unchanged pixels must be preserved exactly."
